# Atomic Microsizer: "Equipped creature gets +1/+0." "Equip {2}": on turn 1 with only Mox Jet's mana available the equip is refused (short by one);
# once Mox Ruby is cast, the two together pay exactly {2} and the pool is empty. On turn 3 the equipped Ornithopter (1/2) attacks and its trigger
# targets itself (one of two creatures; Mox Jet, no creature, is refused): it can't be blocked (Bot2's Ornithopter may not block it) and has base
# power and toughness 1/1, +1/+0 on top: 2/1, so Bot2 takes exactly 2. After the turn it is 1/2 again.

